    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="ea8da612-9d73-54f6-8285-420de6201552" activityNameId="503f2f61-d8e6-5a9f-a917-77ff23dd0906" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Electrode, negative, LiC6, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Electrode, negative, LiC6, at plant
The functional unit represents 1 kg of the negative LiC6 electrode material for the production of LiIo rechargable batteries. Process data is taken mainly from an environmental report of a battery producer as well as from literature. In addition own measurements of sizes and weights of batteries were used.;
UUID: c8e4ee89-e540-3996-8075-40cc6b9227b5
(Raw) materials, transport and production efforts of the negative electrode of LiIo rechargable batteries. Neither waste nor emissions to air or water are taken into account.
Location: This module relates to the global situation.
Technology: Construction details as described for LiIo rechargable batteries and manufacturing conditions as documented in the environmental report were adopted.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature, measurements 
Extrapolations: see technology &amp; general comments
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_c8e4ee89-e540-3996-8075-40cc6b9227b5.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
